      <span style="color: var(--accent-crimson); font-weight: 600;">sufficiency</span>, 
      <span style="color: #D4AF37;">Osettai</span>, and the road east.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 8px; color: rgba(244, 241, 234, 0.7);">
      Features verified pilgrim aliases, thread subscriptions, and communal dispatches.
    </p>
  </div>
